Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.69,0:00:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.59,0:00:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.99,0:00:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.67,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, and so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.99,0:00:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.81,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll live in wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.98,0:01:56.03,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(984,978)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(942,984,\1a&H00&)\t(5072,5113,\1a&HFF&)}Straight Ahead!
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.98,0:01:56.03,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(984,978)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Straight Ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.31,0:01:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.61,0:02:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tears are making a rainbow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The film is crying, we'll drown here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.79,0:02:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's practically a waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.43,0:02:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Brogy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.53,0:02:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.21,0:02:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.47,0:02:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.71,0:02:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.30,0:02:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.83,0:02:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.74,0:02:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dory!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.66,0:02:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.57,0:02:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must've lost consciousness
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.85,0:02:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.25,0:02:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zero
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.13,0:02:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that name somewhere before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.07,0:02:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that the name of the boss\Nguy that Vivi was so frightened of?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which would mean that the person who was\Non the other end of this transponder scale
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.81,0:03:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is one of the seven warlords of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time since\NI issued your orders, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.91,0:03:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.82,0:03:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening on that island?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.51,0:03:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, so I guess this Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three character is the owner\Nof this transponder snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.45,0:03:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I have this figured out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.77,0:03:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little place here is an enemy\Nhideout, and someone named Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.79,0:03:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three was ordered by someone named Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.59,0:03:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zero to come to this island\Nand kill Vivi. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.85,0:03:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.09,0:03:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was no time for me to\Nbe out on a hunting trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.11,0:03:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that they're all still okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, are you going to answer me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.47,0:03:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I ask a question, I expect an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.19,0:03:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you eliminated Princess Phoebe\Nand the Straw Hats as you were ordered?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.17,0:03:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mission was successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.89,0:03:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I eliminated all those pesky\Nbrats like you said to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.81,0:03:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your secret is completely protected,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so there's no need to keep going\Nafter them anymore. I see. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.19,0:03:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as we speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.61,0:03:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Unluckies are headed your way in order\Nto confirm the success of your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.57,0:03:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to deliver a certain package.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.63,0:04:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The unluckies, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.09,0:04:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a package?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.31,0:04:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an eternal pose that\Nwill point you to Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.09,0:04:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once that arrives, you and Miss\NGolden Week will head for Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.99,0:04:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for the next phase of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are about to begin, embarking upon\Nour most important operation to date.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.73,0:04:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Details will follow\Nafter you reach Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.21,0:04:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.41,0:04:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.49,0:04:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.40,0:04:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.51,0:04:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, it's nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.07,0:04:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I guess you're trying to kill me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.01,0:04:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, monkey, bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.93,0:05:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.17,0:05:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are you going to do\Nnow, you oversized chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.27,0:05:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?\NAnswer me, Mr. Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, well, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.75,0:05:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.83,0:05:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that damn Straw Hat was still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.57,0:05:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.83,0:05:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finished him off real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.43,0:05:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.45,0:05:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, he was still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that just a moment ago you said
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.83,0:05:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that your mission was\Ncompleted successfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.09,0:05:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that is what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.35,0:05:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I absolutely thought\Nthat it was completed then,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.73,0:05:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that Straw Hat guy is really\Na lot tougher than you'd expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:05:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let me see, if I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.73,0:06:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The report you gave me was a complete lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.85,0:06:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.31,0:06:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you put it that way, I guess\Nthe report wasn't the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, now I've gotten rid\Nof that Straw Hat for sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so there's no need for you to send\Nanyone else after him or the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.61,0:06:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the pose and head straight to\NAlabasta from there immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.27,0:06:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.91,0:06:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, how are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.13,0:06:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.37,0:06:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.21,0:06:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.05,0:06:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even weapons made in\NElbaph could hold up after
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.45,0:06:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a hundred years of giants\Ndueling to the death with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be dull by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.93,0:06:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.35,0:06:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Broggy, would you let go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.31,0:06:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a little sore here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.75,0:06:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're still\Nalive, Brogy! It's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:06:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, this wasn't a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that those weapons\Nare even intact after
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.05,0:07:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a century of fighting\Nis the miraculous part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.23,0:07:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should be scrapped by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised they lasted this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.71,0:07:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a day this was!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.29,0:07:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, god of Elbat,\Nfor this wonderful day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.27,0:07:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that true, Brogy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.45,0:07:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying that fighting\Nme while I was injured,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.57,0:07:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cutting me down and knocking\Nme out was all wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be an idiot, Dory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.31,0:07:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm saying and you know it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.91,0:07:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you keep your hands off my wounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.19,0:07:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You try doing that again\Nand see how far you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.05,0:07:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can take you down in a heartbeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.71,0:07:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.41,0:07:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two are fighting again already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.99,0:07:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have no more radio\Ncontact from now on, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:08:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Marines were to catch on to what\Nwe're doing, that would be most unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.23,0:08:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this point on,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of my orders will be sent via\Nletter, following the usual protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That will be all, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.47,0:08:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.38,0:08:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck on your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.63,0:08:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Allsunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.07,0:08:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.23,0:08:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to send Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two to Little Garden immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.77,0:08:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.68,0:08:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three is on his way from\NLittle Garden to Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.21,0:08:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to see that he is eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps that might be a\Nlittle extreme, Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still have plenty of agents to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.73,0:08:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you arguing with me, Miss Allsunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.89,0:08:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make the arrangements at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.51,0:08:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.89,0:08:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he finally hung up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.93,0:08:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I wonder who these guys were.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.93,0:08:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sure are funny looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.57,0:09:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.92,0:09:09.72,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(978,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(936,978,\1a&H00&)}At Sea (The Grand Line)
Dialogue: 2,0:09:03.92,0:09:09.72,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(978,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(936,978,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}At Sea (The Grand Line)
Dialogue: 3,0:09:03.92,0:09:09.72,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(978,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}At Sea (The Grand Line)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.75,0:09:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Smoker, I've just\Nintercepted a very intriguing signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such an incredible full temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.47,0:09:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The legendary Kashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.51,0:09:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tashigi! Tashigi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.65,0:09:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only here in the Grand Line could I find\Nsuch a prized sword as this so quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.11,0:09:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tashigi! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.75,0:09:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, they're coming, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.55,0:09:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop clowning around and get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.99,0:09:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to listen to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.59,0:09:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.83,0:09:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just picked up this\Nconversation minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.43,0:09:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got it all queued up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, Sergeant Major? Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.89,0:09:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lay it back, please. It's Mr. Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.41,0:09:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now quit fooling around, you jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.71,0:09:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you eliminated Princess Phoebe\Nand the Straw Hats as you were ordered?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:09:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.04,0:10:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Pirates! Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.15,0:10:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mission was successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.07,0:10:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this point on,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.48,0:10:10.15,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)}Black Wiretapper Snail
Dialogue: 2,0:10:05.48,0:10:10.15,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Black Wiretapper Snail
Dialogue: 3,0:10:05.48,0:10:10.15,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Black Wiretapper Snail
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.51,0:10:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all my orders will be sent via\Nletter following the usual protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That will be all, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.89,0:10:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.80,0:10:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the rest of the message\Nis undecipherable static.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.39,0:10:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a faint signal,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.67,0:10:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there are key names and phrases laced
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in their conversation\Nthat clearly stood out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi, Straw Hats,\NOrders via Letter, and Mr. Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.01,0:10:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Zero?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.15,0:10:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could that be a codename for somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.25,0:10:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.16,0:10:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's quite possible he\Ncould be connected to that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.91,0:10:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,suspicious swordsman we\Ncaught earlier in Rudeness.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.26,0:10:43.18,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,476)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,450)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(437,478,\1a&H00&)\t(7444,7485,\1a&HFF&)}Mr. 11\NFrontier Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 2,0:10:35.26,0:10:43.18,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,476)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,450)\3c&HFAFAFB&\c&HFAFAFB&\1a&HFF&\t(437,478,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&\t(7444,7485,\1a&HFF&)}Mr. 11\NFrontier Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 3,0:10:35.26,0:10:43.18,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(478,476)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,450)\c&HFAFAFB&\4a&HFF&}Mr. 11\NFrontier Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.63,0:10:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say his name was? Mr. Eleven?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.81,0:10:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Part of a criminal organization that uses
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.49,0:10:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,numbers for codenames and\Nsends orders via letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.11,0:10:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound about right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.23,0:10:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.14,0:10:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Zero. Organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.41,0:10:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what you're going on about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.01,0:10:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then how do you explain the letter of\Ndetailed orders we found in your pocket?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:10:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.79,0:10:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I burned it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not... not mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.49,0:11:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because we didn't actually\Nfind anything in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.59,0:11:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi, if I remember correctly,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's from Alabasta, and reports\Nsay she's currently missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.73,0:11:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me for interrupting, but isn't the\NAlabasta Kingdom in the middle of a coup?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.31,0:11:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this mysterious\Ncriminal organization and the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Pirates could somehow\Nbe involved in the uprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.99,0:11:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.21,0:11:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I know for certain\Nis that this is the only
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clue we have to the\NStraw Hat's whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.53,0:11:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This means we're going? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.79,0:11:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to contact headquarters\Nand get an eternal pose. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time we pay a little visit\Nto Alabasta, the Kingdom of Sand.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.88,0:11:58.09,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,478)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)\t(3732,3774,\1a&HFF&)}Little Garden, Island of Giants
Dialogue: 2,0:11:53.88,0:11:58.09,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,478)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)\t(3732,3774,\1a&HFF&)\4a&HFF&}Little Garden, Island of Giants
Dialogue: 3,0:11:53.88,0:11:58.09,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,478)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,715)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Little Garden, Island of Giants
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah, gah, gah, gah,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been fighting so\Nlong that we had completely
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.41,0:12:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forgotten about the bounties\Nthat were put on our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.91,0:12:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.67,0:12:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm the whole reason that the Baroque\NWorks agents came here in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.13,0:12:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.95,0:12:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of that anymore, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.15,0:12:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come on, Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.25,0:12:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you so sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.45,0:12:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, have a rice cracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.65,0:12:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.63,0:12:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you get those? I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.85,0:12:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's have a rice cracker party.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.87,0:12:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rice crackers aren't\Nthat exciting, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.63,0:12:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.87,0:12:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can even toast with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.13,0:12:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, nobody's blaming you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.41,0:12:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.51,0:12:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't just go wasting food like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.51,0:12:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, you should know better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.23,0:12:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.85,0:12:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who said you could have my cracker?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.61,0:12:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, put it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.52,0:12:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you break it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.35,0:12:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My nose done! What's with you? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.35,0:12:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a bug bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.05,0:12:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe we have to wait here\Na year just for the Log Pose to reset.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.51,0:13:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.42,0:13:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's definitely something\Nwe should be worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.41,0:13:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you helped save\Nus from those other guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.01,0:13:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can't We would really\Nlike to return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.81,0:13:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe you guys can do something about\Nour Log Pose, so we won't be stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.95,0:13:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the Log Pose is the one\Nthing that we can't help you with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.99,0:13:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course he's happy,\Nthe big useless jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.29,0:13:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shows up after we've\Ntaken care of everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.25,0:13:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.25,0:13:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is one of you guys Mr. Three?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, and just how do you know about Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.99,0:13:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.17,0:13:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look absolutely\Namazing in that outfit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.51,0:13:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you stand around dressed like\Nthat all day, you'll catch cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.61,0:13:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, take my coat. Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.43,0:13:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I've been a little busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.99,0:14:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just finished talking to that Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zero guy over a transponder snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Zero?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.93,0:14:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was talking to him in this weird\Nhideout place I found in the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.75,0:14:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thought I was some guy called Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, and I thought it would be\Na good idea to let him believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since I had him on the line, I went\Nahead and told him that we were all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.01,0:14:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he thinks he doesn't have to\Nsend people after us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.71,0:14:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying that we're\Nfinally free of people
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,chasing us now that we\Ncan't go anywhere anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.65,0:14:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that is just perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.95,0:14:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, is there still something\Nwe need to take care of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.05,0:14:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a real shame after I\Nmanaged to get hold of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.07,0:14:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.53,0:14:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An eternal pose to Alabasta!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.77,0:14:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.15,0:14:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can set sail! Oh,\Nwoohoo! Yes! Like a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did the awesome thing would happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.31,0:15:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was getting really worried, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.57,0:15:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, it was all my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.31,0:15:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad I could\Nmake you happy, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.79,0:15:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.91,0:15:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're having a rice\Ncracker party! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.13,0:15:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Luffy, we don't have\Nenough left for a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.43,0:15:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only three. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.57,0:15:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for that anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now, Captain! We don't have\Ntime to be sitting here. Zoro, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.41,0:15:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a sec so uh you forget about our\Nhunting contest nope hate to tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.79,0:15:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this but you lost i caught a rhino\Nthat was this big that doesn't sound
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very tasty, but I guess you can. It\Nsounds just fine to me. Hunting contest?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.73,0:15:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hunting contest something about\Nthat sounds familiar somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.69,0:15:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, giant old guys, it's really been\Na lot of fun, but we gotta go! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.65,0:15:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.43,0:15:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can tell you need to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.47,0:16:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too bad that you\Nhave to leave so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.81,0:16:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll get to\Nyour homeland in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.81,0:16:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.77,0:16:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.89,0:16:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try not to die anymore, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.41,0:16:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waaaaaah! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.73,0:16:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to visit Elbaph someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.29,0:16:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.71,0:16:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My catch is much bigger than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wish. This is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.65,0:16:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way to see this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.23,0:16:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.11,0:16:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our friends are setting sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.65,0:16:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.73,0:16:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we can't just sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.33,0:16:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not when there's a monster\Nwaiting for them in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.61,0:16:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Dory, how are your wounds doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.07,0:16:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bees, I think I can live with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.75,0:16:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's safe to say that our\Nweapons are about worn through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.83,0:16:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any regrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's difficult to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.75,0:16:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've fought with this axe for\Nmore than a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.85,0:16:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if it's a sacrifice for our\Nfriends, then it's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:17:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.53,0:17:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you mine was bigger than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.71,0:17:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.63,0:17:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should look closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.85,0:17:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lizard is much bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.15,0:17:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you blind or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.09,0:17:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My rhino is obviously so much\Nlarger than your stupid lizard is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.19,0:17:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They both look yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.45,0:17:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut up, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.03,0:17:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yours doesn't even have horns!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.03,0:17:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that have to do with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.81,0:17:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Size!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.72,0:17:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yours is puny!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.64,0:17:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My children, how long\Nare you going to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.89,0:17:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need all of it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.19,0:17:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just cut up what we do need so\Nwe can get out of here already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.37,0:17:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.28,0:17:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.27,0:17:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp, would you tell him\Nthat I'm clearly the winner?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.67,0:17:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I really don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.09,0:17:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you just agree it's a tie?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.13,0:17:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe in ties.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fight to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.37,0:17:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hurry up, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.97,0:17:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.57,0:18:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The giant said that going straight would\Ntake us to the western end of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.67,0:18:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, couldn't you guys have\Ngotten any more meat on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.35,0:18:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.26,0:18:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't possibly preserve\Nany more than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.75,0:18:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would just spoil before we could eat it\Nare you actively trying to sink the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.89,0:18:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey look at that it's the giants they\Nmust have come down here to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.11,0:18:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A great danger still lies ahead of you it\Nis an obstacle that has always been here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.31,0:18:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to prevent people from\Nreaching the next island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.99,0:18:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh... uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.95,0:18:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every one of you fought like true warriors
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.11,0:18:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in order to protect the pride of our duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.41,0:18:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And because you are willing to do that\Nno matter what enemy you may face...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will never let them\Ndestroy your pride, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.91,0:18:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have faith in what we say!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.11,0:18:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.03,0:19:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\Nkeep going straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.39,0:19:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.99,0:19:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.99,0:19:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.11,0:19:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it what he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.79,0:19:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, just go straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.79,0:19:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.77,0:19:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's meet again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.39,0:19:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.77,0:19:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look! Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.63,0:19:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Land Eater!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.45,0:19:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will open the path!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.25,0:19:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the name of Elbaph, you will open it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.23,0:19:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.13,0:20:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.31,0:20:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A goldfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.45,0:20:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.83,0:20:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giant goldfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.57,0:20:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, hey, start working the\Nrunner or we're gonna be eaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.55,0:20:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.67,0:20:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know, but we have to go straight\Nahead, isn't that right, Luffy? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We sure do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.45,0:20:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be a moron, Lupi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.17,0:20:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't gonna be anything\Nlike what happened with Laboon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.61,0:20:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. Now calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.57,0:20:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll let you have\Nthe last rice cracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.09,0:20:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want a cracker!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.25,0:20:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't turn the ship around\Nright now, that thing is gonna eat us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.93,0:20:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, just give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.29,0:20:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you really sure we can\Ntrust those little pals of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:20:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.60,0:20:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we actually going to willingly\Nhead straight into that beast's belly?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.93,0:21:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late to turn now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.59,0:21:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've sure gotten a lot\Nbigger, Island Eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.99,0:21:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Filthy goldfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.29,0:21:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And his size isn't the only\Nsurprising thing about him either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.51,0:21:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's also the dung that he\Nproduces after he devours an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.57,0:21:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The size of that stuff\Nis quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.27,0:21:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I recall one specimen that's\Nknown as nothing at all island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.17,0:21:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.08,0:21:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we landed on it a long time ago and thought\Nit was real land we were standing on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.17,0:21:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to feel nostalgic\Nwatching them sail in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.11,0:21:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember my old adventurous days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.99,0:21:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing we can't pierce with
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.31,0:21:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this weapon is the great\Nbloodstained snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.77,0:21:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together our weapons form the most powerful\Nweapon Elbaph can offer the giant spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.85,0:22:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go straight go\Nstraight what does it matter
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.93,0:22:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've already been eaten\Nhere straight okay just?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.51,0:22:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JUST KEEP GOING!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.09,0:22:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.47,0:22:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't bother looking back. Because\Nwe're going straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.63,0:22:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.29,0:22:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.67,0:22:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.49,0:22:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The strength of the Elbaph warriors!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.45,0:22:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.63,0:23:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.45,0:23:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go! Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.93,0:23:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.13,0:23:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sea was ruled by\Ncolossal swashbuckling
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.47,0:23:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ruffians known as the\NGiant Warrior Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.99,0:23:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Living only for the thrill\Nof battle and conquest,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.39,0:23:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these pirates laid waste\Nto all who opposed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.05,0:23:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were presided over by two bosses,\NRed Ogre Brogy and Blue Ogre Dory,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.57,0:23:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,both exceptionally strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.11,0:23:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power and influence they\Nheld went largely unchecked,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.93,0:23:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for no other giant was their equal,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.71,0:23:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and ordinary men cowered\Nin their massive shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.49,0:23:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This made the fact that a lone\Nlittle girl single-handedly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.11,0:23:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,put an end to their attacks\Nall the more surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.05,0:24:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our two bosses are truly great!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.15,0:24:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear about their catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.31,0:24:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can hardly think about\Nanything else that's so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.95,0:24:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not every day someone bags a\Nhuge sea king, and they each got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.77,0:24:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.17,0:24:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, take us for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.71,0:24:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're Elbaph giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.95,0:24:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No greater warrior exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.77,0:24:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even we don't come close to taking\Ndown one of those massive beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.39,0:24:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you say that's fair, man? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.09,0:24:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet that no one's ever slayed a
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.45,0:24:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bigger sea king than us a conquest
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.31,0:24:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was bigger? What
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.59,0:24:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which one
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.87,0:24:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.63,0:24:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at them
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.53,0:24:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,side by side brogy mine is slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.67,0:25:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bigger see keep dreaming My beat's\Nyours by three whole centimeters! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.87,0:25:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're joking! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.71,0:25:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bosses, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.15,0:25:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop bickering!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.59,0:25:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I should mention, Brogy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.93,0:25:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I recall something about a hunting\Ncontest, but I can't exactly remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.05,0:25:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Dorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.37,0:25:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same thing goes for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.23,0:25:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Middle Mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.41,0:25:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do you say you and I\Ngo ahead and finish this? Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.51,0:25:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can always think\Nthings through after that!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.49,0:26:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Set me free.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.07,0:26:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something has to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.39,0:26:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My world can be arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.91,0:26:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything as\Nlong as you are with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.25,0:26:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've grown stronger having you by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.25,0:26:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've started on an everlasting ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.37,0:26:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm invincible when your love is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.93,0:26:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm with you, I have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.23,0:26:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how far we can make this go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.45,0:26:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world is ours, you just ride, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.67,0:26:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see it shine in the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.23,0:26:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glistening like water when\Nthe sun rises in the dawn.

